# Sample knowledge document

This is a placeholder so the bucket has at least one indexable file.
Replace it (and add more) before running `agentq kb upload`.

## How {{project.display_name}} uses this

The agent's `vertex_ai_search` tool searches the Vertex AI Search datastore
configured in `agentq.config.yaml` (`knowledge_base.datastore_id`). At
runtime the datastore's full resource path is read from the `KB_DATASTORE`
environment variable, which `agentq-cli` injects automatically.
